Start of a transcript of
MOSTLY HARMLESS: THE LONG WAY ROUND
An unofficial interactive fan adaptation of the fifth book.
Release 1 / Serial number 261116 / Inform v6.45 Library v6.12.8 S
Standard interpreter 1.1 (1F) / Library Serial Number 251226

>hello
Hello, yourself. There is nobody here to hear you who has not already heard.

>/endscript
There is no slash command called /endscript. /HELP lists them.

>/script
Transcripting is already on.

>/help

Commands outside the story start with a slash, as in a chat program:

  /SAVE  /RESTORE  /RESTART  /QUIT  /UNDO       the game itself
  /SCORE  /FULLSCORE  /NOTIFY ON|OFF            your progress
  /VERBOSE  /BRIEF  /SUPERBRIEF                 how much is described
  /SCRIPT  /UNSCRIPT                            a transcript of your game
  /HINT [BACK]  /DIFFICULTY  /ABOUT  /VERSION  /HELP    help
  /MACRO RECORD|STOP|PLAY|LIST|SHOW|DELETE   record and replay commands
  /INTRO  /HHGG                              overviews for newcomers

Everything else you type is part of the story. Plain English is fine, and so are
questions, such as WHO IS FORD PREFECT? Without the slash, those words are just
ordinary input, and the game will tell you if you needed one.

>/unscript

End of transcript.
